    "detailed_description": "You have been summoned to this realm, there is no way out, not even death. There is a godkiller bringing chaos to the gods and it is up to you, being the daughter of Zeus, to find how to bring balance to the gods. <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash powerful combos and sequences!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face huge bosses and different enemies!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/0777e41b489971b86849c3f98d67f18d.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/0777e41b489971b86849c3f98d67f18d.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/0777e41b489971b86849c3f98d67f18d.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover up to 16 new spells that will make Thalia a true goddess!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/d5d5d41795529edda59b6748ce28cfad.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/d5d5d41795529edda59b6748ce28cfad.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/d5d5d41795529edda59b6748ce28cfad.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover up to 30 relics! Thalia will only get stronger!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/33a6dbef30a1cf09ba95d6e73233407b.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/33a6dbef30a1cf09ba95d6e73233407b.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/33a6dbef30a1cf09ba95d6e73233407b.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find and power-up your companions to help you in this journey!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "You have been summoned to this realm, there is no way out, not even death. There is a godkiller bringing chaos to the gods and it is up to you, being the daughter of Zeus, to find how to bring balance to the gods. <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/a4be730a2560bf7b16081f8e0c040575.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash powerful combos and sequences!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/cad69cb33fc11beb9714438e3ba82fda.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face huge bosses and different enemies!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/0777e41b489971b86849c3f98d67f18d.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_