tem_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.poster.avif?t=1749448238\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.webm?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685410/extras/914d0aa109f185d78089b185a31034d0.mp4?t=1749448238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
